<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 93 0 R
/E (For this experiment, a simple Solidity smart contract based on the selected mini-project is created. The contract may contain functions to store, modify, and retrieve information depending on the requirements of the mini-project. The lab manual specifically instructs students to create a simple smart contract based on their chosen mini-project. )
/Pg 11 0 R
